  "prefLabel": "En 1013.01 Export Capacity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1013.01 Export Capacity. If a facility uses any configuration or operating mode pursuant to En 1013.03 to limit the export or import of electrical power across the PCC, then the import capacity or export capacity shall be only the amount capable of being imported or exported, excluding any inadvertent export. To prevent impacts on system safety and reliability, any inadvertent import and export from a facility shall comply with the limits identified in this section. The export capacity or import capacity specified by the applicant in the application shall subsequently be included as a limitation in the IA.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
